From 58394eaf232d21a076c19f4e1185970578116cb1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 22:11:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 60 fps step 1: late tick phase and idempotent render passes
 (infrastructure)

- Late tick: an object can get a third callback (addObjectLate) that runs
  once per tick right after every object's tick and before the first render
  pass, in WORLD_OBJECTS slot order (the order the renders ran in). State
  that render callbacks used to advance moves there, so it keeps the exact
  timing it had (after all ticks) whatever the number of render passes.
  gameLoop calls lateTickObjects(); the other loops (battle, VS, tournament,
  pause) get it from renderObjects() through a pending flag set by
  tickObjects(), so shared objects (fades, UI boxes) keep working there.
- removeObjectAfterRender: a late tick that ends an object whose render
  still draws a last frame frees its slot after the render passes.
- MOD_RENDER_PASS (0 on the tick, late tick and first pass). Sounds
  (playSound, playSound2) and text VRAM uploads (drawString,
  clearTextSubArea) only happen on pass 0.
- Rollback list (menu state machines, medal spin, Monochromon bubble, item
  textbox timer, UI_BOX_DATA): extra passes start from the values these had
  before pass 0 and put pass 0's values back afterwards.
- Extra passes render with the libgs view state of pass 0 (POSITION,
  GsWSMATRIX, GsWSMATRIX_ORG, GsLIGHTWSMATRIX, projection): the camera set
  before tickObjects, not the post-tick DRAWING_OFFSET/GS_VIEWPOINT.
- Prims some ticks add into pass 0's OT (save machine menu drawn from the
  script tick, Meramon shake) are added again at the start of extra passes.
- modRenderRand/modRenderCustomRandom: rand()/customRandom() on pass 0, a
  private generator on extra passes, so the game's RNG streams advance as
  with one render per tick.
- An extra pass only starts if it ends before the tick's third refresh
  (cost of pass 0 plus the measured pass setup, against the lines left
  since the last vblank); diagnostics MOD_PERF_LATE / XSTART / XEND.
- Linker script: keep the new .sbss/.bss of world_object.c, entity_text.c
  and game_menu.c.

